WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.710
A double security fence
surrounds a 105 foot

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.330
diameter flat concrete
platform.

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.630
And a close analysis of
the approach road reveals

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.310
This is no ordinary
structure.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.300
Where the road comes in
to the compound.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.460
The shadows really give
the impression that the

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.630
road doesn't stay flat,
but actually dips down.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.900
Is this compound hiding
secrets that are somehow

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.050
related to a more
sinister purpose.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.740
Military analyst Carlos
Munoz finds some historic

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.830
images that seem to
confirm that this rural

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.830
landscape conceals a
terrifying secret.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:43.550
The remote location, the
security perimeter, what

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.520
looks like an
underground bunker.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:48.740
It is the launch site
for a nuclear missile.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.100
Declassified military
records confirm this

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.890
location was one of a
series of top secret

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.670
bunkers.

